{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10282250","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282250","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1028225001:1":{"text":"This is all my fault... I didn't take good care of them. ","source_cn":"呜呜……都怪我，没能好好照顾我的花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32C5D8D952AC6955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028225002:1":{"text":"The flowers here... each one was so beautiful. I can remember every one of them...","source_cn":"这里的花……每一株都很漂亮，它们的样子我都记得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A3B82479FA60C0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028225003:1":{"text":"When I was sad, I'd come here to water them and get rid of their pests. It made me so happy to see them grow. ","source_cn":"我不开心的时候，就来这里给它们浇水、除虫。只要它们长得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEBB27485CB43911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028225004:1":{"text":"But after the corruption appeared, the academy didn't let us leave. I-I didn't know this would happen to them...","source_cn":"可是附近发生腐化以后，老师禁止我们出学院……呜呜，我不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3CBB68AD9052690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028225005:1":{"text":"Can you all help me bury them?","source_cn":"呜呜……你们，能、能帮我……帮我把它们埋葬了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023FE4D24E89D413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028225005":{"text":"Can you all help me bury them?","source_cn":"呜呜……你们，能、能帮我……帮我把它们埋葬了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023FE4D24E89D413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028225006:1":{"text":"Thank you... *Cry*...","source_cn":"谢谢……呜，谢谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E29996F1FCEB12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"(Nod in agreement) ","source_cn":"（点头答应）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x34FA657DE1102E88","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Nod in agreement) ","female":"(Nod in agreement) ","variant_male_record_index":"61730","variant_female_record_index":"61731","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兰迪":{"text":"Randy","source":"兰迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":1}}